Z||000006||308||09-11-2001||08:21 AM||||I wanted to Thank everyone for there feedback, I FIXED THE CRUISE CONTROL at no cost, It was the Brake pedal switch not going in enough, and ya know the guy I baught the car from said it never worked so It has been like this for 6 years. WE'll Thanks LArry||||reg||1
